@title Two closed-loop winches: an open coil on one STO channel of winch B is found and trips only winch B
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# Lane L2c, pair. Simulate > Defects and walk-throughs (which switches Live on) opens the coil of STO channel 1,
# then Simulate > Drive run starts the winch. The two channels disagree, the drive latches the
# discrepancy after its time (1 s) and the run lists it.
open qa/fixtures/closed-winch-pair.novo
wait 20
click_text Simulate
wait 5
click_text "Defects and walk-throughs"
wait 20
click_text "Contact welded closed"
wait 5
click_text "Coil open (never operates)"
wait 5
click_text "choose..."
wait 5
click_text "=A1+CAB-STOC"
wait 5
click_text "Inject defect"
wait 20
expect "DEFECT INJECTED"
shot defect-injected
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate drive run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
click_text "Start"
wait 400
expect "Winch B tripped"
shot sto-discrepancy-found
check_layout
